{"unit_id":"hherosoul__dsh-smart-charts#card-zh","repo":"hherosoul/dsh-smart-charts","commit":"0595787f346e53c81d617ce3f86888ebbd58b5d8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"智能图表（Smart Charts）是面向 DSH 的数据可视化技能插件，通过注册打包的 smart-charts 技能，让 agent 将 CSV、TSV、TXT、Excel 或 JSON 表格转换为独立交互式 ECharts HTML。用户可先生成数据画像，再选图并用 pandas 转换数据；支持多图批量输出、统计摘要、三套主题及中国省级和世界地图。适合需要从本地表格快速制作趋势、对比、分布或关系图的场景，生成文件保存到指定输出目录。图表流程需要 Python 3.11+ 及技能 requirements.txt 中的依赖，不需要额外 API key 或在线图表服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:9-15","skills/smart-charts/scripts/cli.py:42-55","skills/smart-charts/scripts/chart_generator.py:1-8","skills/smart-charts/SKILL.md:42-69"]}
{"unit_id":"hherosoul__dsh-smart-charts#card-en","repo":"hherosoul/dsh-smart-charts","commit":"0595787f346e53c81d617ce3f86888ebbd58b5d8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Smart Charts is a DSH skill plugin that registers a packaged skill for turning CSV, Excel, and JSON tables into standalone interactive ECharts HTML. It supports data profiling, chart generation, batch charts, statistics, themes, and local Python dependencies.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:9-15","skills/smart-charts/scripts/cli.py:42-55","skills/smart-charts/scripts/chart_generator.py:1-8","skills/smart-charts/SKILL.md:42-69"]}
