{"unit_id":"hherosoul__dsh-smart-charts#feature-feature-profile","repo":"hherosoul/dsh-smart-charts","commit":"0595787f346e53c81d617ce3f86888ebbd58b5d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Smart Charts 的功能「数据画像」：先读取表格并汇总列类型、基数、缺失值、样本和统计，还会给出粒度与候选信号；通过 --profile 使用，不生成图表文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/smart-charts/scripts/profile.py:1-18","skills/smart-charts/scripts/cli.py:215-260"]}
{"unit_id":"hherosoul__dsh-smart-charts#feature-feature-formats","repo":"hherosoul/dsh-smart-charts","commit":"0595787f346e53c81d617ce3f86888ebbd58b5d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Smart Charts 的功能「多格式导入」：读取 CSV、TSV、TXT、Excel 与 JSON 数据，提供表头、工作表和行过滤选项，解析结果进入统一的 DataFrame 图表流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/smart-charts/scripts/data_parser.py:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"hherosoul__dsh-smart-charts#feature-feature-charts","repo":"hherosoul/dsh-smart-charts","commit":"0595787f346e53c81d617ce3f86888ebbd58b5d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Smart Charts 的功能「多种图表输出」：按指定或自动轴列生成 ECharts 图表，覆盖趋势、比较、分布、层级、流向与地图等类型，并可设置 default、classic 或 dark 主题。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/smart-charts/scripts/chart_generator.py:1-8","skills/smart-charts/scripts/renderers.py:1-10","skills/smart-charts/scripts/themes.py:1-8"]}
{"unit_id":"hherosoul__dsh-smart-charts#feature-feature-batch","repo":"hherosoul/dsh-smart-charts","commit":"0595787f346e53c81d617ce3f86888ebbd58b5d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Smart Charts 的功能「多图批量生成」：通过 --charts 或 --charts-file 提供多张图的 JSON 配置，一次读取数据后逐项生成图表，并在结果中汇总成功与失败数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/smart-charts/scripts/cli.py:215-260","skills/smart-charts/scripts/chart_generator.py:1-8"]}
{"unit_id":"hherosoul__dsh-smart-charts#feature-feature-profile-stats","repo":"hherosoul/dsh-smart-charts","commit":"0595787f346e53c81d617ce3f86888ebbd58b5d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Smart Charts 的功能「图表统计与预览」：每次成功生成图表时返回绘图行数、前十行数据预览和 plot_stats，便于核对实际绘制的数据与聚合口径。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/smart-charts/scripts/chart_generator.py:1-8","skills/smart-charts/scripts/plot_stats.py:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"hherosoul__dsh-smart-charts#feature-feature-map","repo":"hherosoul/dsh-smart-charts","commit":"0595787f346e53c81d617ce3f86888ebbd58b5d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Smart Charts 的功能「离线地图图表」：map 与 lines 图可使用捆绑的中国或世界 GeoJSON，也可由 --geo-path 指定自备 GeoJSON 文件作为区域底图。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/smart-charts/scripts/renderers.py:1-10"]}
